OL,3,AKatherine Ryan says she feels 'grief
OL,4,Aand relief' after Russell Brand
OL,5,Aconviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FRyan said in 2022 that she could not
OL,8,Fname the famous man as it would be a
OL,9,F"litigious minefield" but mentioned
OL,10,Fthat she had appeared on a TV programme
OL,11,Fwith him and told him he was a
OL,12,F"predator" to "his face".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
